        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>线性代数完美总结版</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {\n    inlineMath: [['$', '$']],\n    displayMath: [['$$', '$$']]\n  }\n};\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  html, body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n  }\n  body {\n    background: #f5e94e;\n    font-family: \"SimSun\", \"Songti SC\", serif;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 540px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: #f5e94e;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .band-top {\n    height: 26px;\n    background: #f5e94e;\n  }\n  .sheet {\n    background: #ffffff;\n    padding: 10px 34px 4px 34px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .band-bottom {\n    background: #e8264c;\n    padding: 6px 0 18px 0;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .doc-title {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin: 0 0 8px 0;\n  }\n  .line {\n    font-size: 11.5px;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n  .red {\n    color: #d0021b;\n  }\n  .i1 { padding-left: 14px; }\n  .i2 { padding-left: 28px; }\n  .i3 { padding-left: 42px; }\n  .i4 { padding-left: 56px; }\n  .row {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    font-size: 11.5px;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n  }\n  .row .lead {\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n  .brace {\n    font-size: 34px;\n    line-height: 1;\n    margin: 0 2px 0 4px;\n    font-family: \"SimSun\", serif;\n  }\n  .brace-tall {\n    font-size: 52px;\n  }\n  .stack {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    justify-content: center;\n  }\n  .stack > div {\n    line-height: 1.7;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n  .center {\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .footer-text {\n    font-family: \"SimHei\", \"Heiti SC\", sans-serif;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 20px;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n  }\n  .sec {\n    font-size: 12px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin: 10px 0 2px 0;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"band-top\"></div>\n  <div class=\"sheet\">\n    <p class=\"doc-title\">线性代数完美总结版</p>\n\n    <p class=\"line i1\">(2) 基本结论</p>\n    <p class=\"line i2 red\">判断向量组线性相关(命题 4、2,命题 4、3(2),定理 4、1 及推论 1,定理 4、2)</p>\n\n    <div class=\"row i2\">\n      <span class=\"lead\">充要:$\\alpha_1,\\alpha_2,\\mathsf{L},\\alpha_s$ 线性相关</span>\n      <span class=\"brace\">{</span>\n      <span class=\"stack\">\n        <div>其中至少有一个向量可由其余向量线性表示、</div>\n      </span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"row i2\">\n      <span class=\"lead\">充分:$\\alpha_1,\\alpha_2,\\mathsf{L},\\alpha_s$ 线性相关</span>\n      <span class=\"brace brace-tall\">{</span>\n      <span class=\"stack\">\n        <div>某一个部分向量组线性相关</div>\n        <div>向量的个数大于向量分量的个数</div>\n        <div>$\\alpha_1,\\alpha_2,\\mathsf{L},\\alpha_s$ 被个数少于$s$的向量组线性表示</div>\n      </span>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"line i2 red\">判断向量组线性无关(命题 4、3(3),命题 4、4 的推论)</p>\n\n    <p class=\"line i1\">2、等价向量组</p>\n    <p class=\"line i2\">( I ) 可由( II )线性表示,则 $r(\\mathrm{I}) \\le r(\\mathrm{II})$、</p>\n    <p class=\"line i2\">( I )与( II )等价,则 $r(\\mathrm{I}) = r(\\mathrm{II})$、</p>\n\n    <p class=\"line i1\">3、子空间的验证</p>\n    <p class=\"line i2\">(1) 非空、加法与数量乘法的封闭</p>\n    <p class=\"line i2\">(2) 生成子空间——例 4、9,例 4、35</p>\n\n    <p class=\"line i1\">4、向量组的秩及极大无关组(命题 4、6,定理 4、4 及推论 2),(线性)空间的基与维数</p>\n    <p class=\"line i2\">(1) 写成列向量作作初等行变换,确定向量组的秩与极大无关组、</p>\n    <p class=\"line i2\">(2) 对于$W = L(\\alpha_1,\\alpha_2,\\mathsf{L},\\alpha_s)$,则$\\dim W = r(\\alpha_1,\\alpha_2,\\mathsf{L},\\alpha_s)$、即生成空间的维数与基就是原向量组的秩与极大无关组、</p>\n\n    <p class=\"line i1\">5、坐标的概念、基变换公式与坐标变换公式</p>\n    <p class=\"line i2\">坐标:$\\gamma = x_1\\alpha_1 + x_2\\alpha_2 + \\mathsf{L} + x_s\\alpha_s$ 在基$\\alpha_1,\\alpha_2,\\mathsf{L},\\alpha_s$下的坐标$[x_1,x_2,\\mathsf{L},x_s]^{\\mathrm{T}}$、</p>\n    <p class=\"line i2\">基变换公式:$(\\beta_1,\\beta_2,\\mathsf{L},\\beta_s) = (\\alpha_1,\\alpha_2,\\mathsf{L},\\alpha_s)S$</p>\n    <p class=\"line i2\">坐标变换公式:</p>\n\n    <div class=\"row i3\">\n      <span class=\"stack\">\n        <div>$(\\beta_1,\\beta_2,\\mathsf{L},\\beta_s) = (\\alpha_1,\\alpha_2,\\mathsf{L},\\alpha_s)S$</div>\n        <div>$\\gamma = (\\alpha_1,\\alpha_2,\\mathsf{L},\\alpha_s)X$</div>\n        <div>$\\gamma = (\\beta_1,\\beta_2,\\mathsf{L},\\beta_s)Y$</div>\n      </span>\n      <span class=\"brace brace-tall\">}</span>\n      <span class=\"stack\">\n        <div>$\\Rightarrow X = SY$ 或 $Y = S^{-1}X$</div>\n      </span>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"sec\">四、线性方程组(含参量、不含参量)</p>\n    <p class=\"line i1\">1、解的情况</p>\n\n    <div class=\"row i2\">\n      <span class=\"lead\">(1) &nbsp;$AX = \\beta \\Rightarrow$</span>\n      <span class=\"brace brace-tall\">{</span>\n      <span class=\"stack\">\n        <div>$r(A) \\ne r(\\overline{A})$,无解</div>\n        <div>$= n$,唯一解</div>\n        <div>$r(A) = r(\\overline{A})$</div>\n        <div>$&lt; n$,无穷多解</div>\n      </span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"row i2\">\n      <span class=\"lead\">若 $A$ 就是方阵,则 $AX = \\beta \\Rightarrow$</span>\n      <span class=\"brace brace-tall\">{</span>\n      <span class=\"stack\">\n        <div>$|A| \\ne 0$,唯一解</div>\n        <div>$|A| = 0$&nbsp;&nbsp;$r(A) = r(\\overline{A})$,无穷多解</div>\n        <div>$r(A) \\ne r(\\overline{A})$,无解</div>\n      </span>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"line i2\">(2) 齐次线性方程组 $AX = 0$ 有非零解 $\\Leftrightarrow r(A) &lt; n$、</p>\n    <p class=\"line i3\">若 $A$ 就是方阵,则齐次线性方程组有非零解 $\\Leftrightarrow |A| = 0$、</p>\n\n    <p class=\"line i1\">2、解的结构</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"band-bottom\">\n    <span class=\"footer-text\">—— 阿光爱分享——</span>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
